# Nothing here belongs in a build context. Two of these are not merely
# housekeeping:
#
#   backups/  — full database dumps. Next's `output: "standalone"` copies the
#               whole project directory, so anything reaching the context
#               reaches the image. A production image was shipping a complete
#               dump of users, orders and the audit trail until this line
#               existed. This is the single most important entry in the file.
#
#   *.md      — SPEC.md and BUILD_CHECKLIST.md are internal planning notes:
#               open client questions, unresolved decisions, the reasoning
#               behind them. They do not belong in a deployed artifact.

node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore

backups
attachments
scripts
ops
uploads

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
